<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7439" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">centū^plus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		centum-plus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>hundredfold</i>, <i>centuple</i>
			(eccl. Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fructus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg.
					Luc. 8, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fenoris usus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Alcim. Avit. ad Sor. 365</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">augere populum suum centuplum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. 1
					Par. 21, 3</span></i>
			.—As <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">centū^plum</span></b> ,
			i, n., <i>a hundredfold</i>:
			accipere, Aug. Civ. Dei, 20, 7; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Matt.
				19, 29</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">invenire,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Gen. 26, 12</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">reddere alicui,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Salv. adv. Avar. 3, 17</span></i>
			.</div>
